 total_sentence='Across all timed attempts, the learned application uses '+f"{f['counts']['learned']['total_timed_seconds']:.3f}"+' seconds, native choices use '+f"{f['counts']['native']['total_timed_seconds']:.3f}"+' seconds, and the fixed choice uses '+f"{f['counts']['fixed']['total_timed_seconds']:.3f}"+' seconds. This total includes the unfinished request and all repetitions. The learned application therefore does not reduce total time against native choices on this bounded workload.'
