 text+='The separate gamma-formula checks cover '+str(form['requests'])+' vacuum requests through thirteen loops and '+str(form['gamma_checks'])+' target coefficients. Native Kira confirms '+str(form['native_verified'])+' of the attempted low-loop requests, with '+str(form['native_checks'])+' coefficient comparisons; '+str(form['native_unavailable'])+' attempted native references do not complete. Higher-loop agreement between the finite-product and gamma expressions checks the derivation and implementation, without establishing a native high-loop timing gain.\n\\FloatBarrier\n'
